# KYC/AML Compliance Platform — Environment Variables
#
# Copy to .env and fill in your API key(s) for live LLM mode.
# Leave blank or remove to use mock (deterministic) mode — zero cost.

# --- LLM Provider (pick one) ---
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...

# --- Model Selection ---
# "claude" in the name routes to ChatAnthropic, otherwise ChatOpenAI.
# Claude models are called with effort=low and max_tokens=8192 and no temperature, because
# Claude Haiku 5.5 rejects one (src/llm.py). OpenAI models are still called at temperature 0.
# Development: claude-haiku-5-5 (fast, cheap; the default since 2026-10-13)
# Production:  claude-sonnet-5-5 or gpt-4o (richer reasoning)
DEFAULT_MODEL=claude-haiku-5-5
